.6,1954,48,120,23],[22912,17.1,1954,50,121,21]],"links":[["Cheyenne County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/colorado/cheyenne-county"],["ARC or PLC in Cheyenne County","/arc-plc/colorado/cheyenne-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 15 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and January to February came in under 90% of normal in 40 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 177% of normal in August to September and 66% in January to February. So far in 2026 the middle of the grids shows 19% of normal for March to April. Grid 22309 had its driest year in 1955 at 43%.</p>"}
